SUMMARY:The shadow has news
DESCRIPTION:Carl Jung\n\nIDEA\nRejected psychic material often returns indirectly. What disturbs the self-image may contain information the self needs.\n\nNOTICE\nWhat becomes visible if you treat this as a claim about perception rather than as a slogan?\n\nCONVERSATION\nAn accidental neighbor from the previous seven days: George MacDonald\, “Imagination is serious.” That thought was working with imagination\; today’s works with self. Put them beside each other and ask whether one changes the scale\, frame\, or stakes of the other. If the connection does not survive attention\, let it fail rather than manufacturing one.\n\nCONTEXT\nshadow / individuation. This entry is a compact conceptual paraphrase\, not a quotation.
